{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03124","headline":"和许给事中直夜简诸公 · 张九龄","name":"和许给事中直夜简诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未央钟漏晚，仙宇蔼沈沈。\n武衞千庐合，严扃万户深。\n左掖知天近，南窗见月临。\n树摇金掌露，庭徙玉楼阴。\n他日闻更直，中宵属所钦。\n声华大国宝，夙夜近臣心。\n逸兴乘高阁，雄飞在禁林。\n宁思窃拚者，情发爲知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}